            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nIt was discussed in #400, #1586, and #2025. See [this comment](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/2025#discussioncomment-14515019) for the most up-to-date info.\n\nAs it is planned (but with a low-ish priority), let's leave this one open.",
